              "width": 720,
              "content": "84 skills as one flat wrap of name-only chips could not be searched, and said nothing about what each one does. Same height, three things added: what is picked stays visible as removable chips, a filter matches name and description, and each row carries its one-line summary. The orchestrator toggle returns here, where it was declared; it had been handed to step 4, which stopped drawing it.",
