                  "id": "qcRXk",
                  "name": "note",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "By itself, once claude repaints fullscreen again, leaves the alternate screen, or runs in a new terminal. A session that starts inline, or stays fullscreen, never shows it.",
