                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "oX9Ct",
                  "name": "note",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Claude Code can leave fullscreen without telling the terminal. The panel keeps the fullscreen screen, and the wheel's reports go to a claude that no longer reads them. Tars sees it in the way claude repaints, for Claude and the providers that run on it.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "E8ciqB",
                  "name": "caption",
                  "fill": "$text-muted",
                  "content": "the way back",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
                  "fontSize": 10.5,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "UcJOW",
                  "name": "note",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "restart stops the session and starts the agent again on the same conversation, which opens fullscreen. While the line shows, the wheel is not forwarded.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "y1yrN",
                  "name": "caption",
                  "fill": "$text-muted",
                  "content": "when it goes",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
                  "fontSize": 10.5,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "k1TVwV",
                  "name": "note",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "By itself, once claude repaints fullscreen again, leaves the alternate screen, or runs in a new terminal. A session that starts inline, or stays fullscreen, never shows it.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
