                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "Runs the project: it delegates instead of editing files, and joins the global Chat room. If it is the fleet’s first orchestrator, it also answers Telegram and Slack. A project has one, so switching this on takes the role from the current one. If it is running, saving restarts it once it is free.",
