        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "bBmZc",
          "x": 410,
          "y": 920,
          "name": "note",
          "width": 620,
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 6,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "y9Lgv",
              "name": "cap",
              "fill": "$text-muted",
              "content": "WHY",
              "lineHeight": 1.4,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 10,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 0.6
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "ibGQQ",
              "name": "line 1",
              "fill": "$text-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 620,
              "content": "Before, the import showed names only, and using an imported template sent its prompt at once, with the permissions and the folders the file asked for. Now each template says what it sets before anything is saved: how careful its agents are (Skip all checks in the error colour, and said again above the buttons), the folders they get besides the project, the skills named at the head of every task they start with, and the whole prompt, never cut.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "oYSGo",
              "name": "line 2",
              "fill": "$text-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 620,
              "content": "Characters that do not show (bidi and zero width controls, tag characters, other format characters) are written out, as [U+202E], wherever a template's text appears, and counted under its prompt, so a prompt cannot hide a line from you.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "H0Snbl",
              "name": "line 3",
              "fill": "$text-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 620,
              "content": "A file Tars cannot show as it will be used is refused whole, naming the template and the field (right): a permission mode Tars does not know, a folder that is not an absolute path, a skill that is not a skill name, a prompt that is not text. Nothing runs on import; using a template sends its prompt only if you turn that on (next frame).",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
