          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1100,
          "content": "An agent's panel on the Dashboard shows its session and nothing else, so its header names no view: the history view went on 01/10, and the word that named the live view on 13/10, since there is nothing left to choose. Fullscreen is the arrows after start or stop, turned inward while the panel fills the window. The panel's menu keeps clear, and hide from this board outside fullscreen.",
