        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "YyrMD",
          "name": "intro",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1100,
          "content": "One switch, off until you turn it on. On, Tars writes to your Telegram through the tars-relay plugin on your Hermes, and every reply reaches the orchestrator it answers. Turning it on erases the Tars bot's token and switches the bot off, so the switch asks first. Once on, the row says how the relay stands, read from Tars as it changes: its word in its tone, and a sentence on what to do.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
          "fontSize": 12,
