                  "fill": "$text-muted",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 900,
                  "content": "A row adds up the agent's tasks begun in this timeframe, each at its own cost from its first turn to its last. The charts above count by turn, and also hold what no row does: a task begun earlier, what came before Tars recorded tasks (1.9.3), and Claude Code sessions Tars did not start.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 11,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "u8Uui",
                  "name": "note",
                  "fill": "$text-muted",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 900,
                  "content": "Not counted: a CLI in a terminal that writes no transcript, such as Codex or Gemini. Over ACP, a task is counted at what the run reports.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 11,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
