                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "A file is named by its path as Claude Code sent it, and a tool with nothing to name, an MCP server's for one, by its own name. One line, cut where the line runs out, the whole of it in the title. A call with any field Tars does not show never comes here, an edit's content, a message, a fetch's prompt or a command's timeout for one: the terminal's dialog shows it all and asks, as before the mod.",
