              "content": "A page of More opens as a card above the app, as Claude desktop opens Settings: the app stays as it was under the scrim, the card carries its own sections, and Esc or the cross closes it. Agents, Review, Logs, Vault, Extensions, Usage, Brain and What's New open the same way, in the same card.",
