              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Since 2.0.0 the New interface row shows to everyone, off by default: Settings · Preferences and its light copy draw it off, Settings · Preferences · new interface on and its light copy draw it on. Before 2.0.0 it showed only once \"newInterface\": true in ~/.dorothy/app-settings.json had turned the preview on, so that whoever did could turn it off (JeanBrasse, 12/10).",
