    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "z15hV",
      "x": 34160,
      "y": 0,
      "name": "Windows · caption band and shell · notes",
      "theme": {
        "mode": "dark"
      },
      "width": 720,
      "fill": "$surface",
      "stroke": "$border",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 16,
      "padding": 32,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Auloj",
          "name": "title",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Windows: the caption band and the shell",
          "lineHeight": 1.1,
          "fontFamily": "$font-display",
          "fontSize": 28,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "A1YKlh",
          "name": "Review · Windows caption band",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 6,
          "padding": [
            8,
            0,
            0,
            0
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "g9YeL",
              "name": "caption",
              "fill": "$text-secondary",
              "content": "REVIEW · WINDOWS CAPTION BAND",
              "lineHeight": 1.2,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 10,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 0.8
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "vRtFG",
              "name": "line",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Windows draws no frame. Its three caption buttons, 46 by 32 each, sit over the top right of the window, painted by Windows in the theme's colours: the band in --bg-primary, the glyphs in --text-primary. WindowsCaption.tsx gives them both at launch and at every change of theme.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "l2qTeH",
              "name": "line",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "The top 32 px left of the buttons move the window, and so does the page header; every control in the header, and every overlay over it, stays clickable. What is drawn from the very top keeps its controls below the band: a fullscreen terminal, the Projects drawer's header, the broadcast banner.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "WipIu",
              "name": "line",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "The light copy shows the same corner in the light theme. The band is invisible on purpose: it has the page's own background.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "YtAQk",
          "name": "Settings · Terminal · the shell, on Windows · states",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 6,
          "padding": [
            8,
            0,
            0,
            0
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "y4z3Ry",
              "name": "caption",
              "fill": "$text-secondary",
              "content": "SETTINGS · TERMINAL · THE SHELL, ON WINDOWS · STATES",
              "lineHeight": 1.2,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 10,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 0.8
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "c73DA",
              "name": "line",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "The Shell row comes first in Settings, Terminal, on Windows only: Default (the shell Tars picks when none is chosen, named), the shells this machine has with their file or path, one not installed dimmed, and Custom path, which adds a Shell path row saved on Enter or when the field is left. PowerShell 7, Windows PowerShell and the Command Prompt are always listed, dimmed as not installed when missing; Git Bash only once it is installed. Default is PowerShell 7 when pwsh.exe is on the PATH, Windows PowerShell otherwise: a PowerShell 7 installed off the PATH is listed with its path, beside a Default that reads Windows PowerShell.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "D9gDd",
              "name": "line",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Its list is the app's Dropdown, at least as wide as the control and aligned to its left edge: with a long path in a hint it runs past the row's right edge, as drawn.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "RIoHl",
          "name": "Against DESIGN.md",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 6,
          "padding": [
            8,
            0,
            0,
            0
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "b5FMq",
              "name": "caption",
              "fill": "$text-secondary",
              "content": "AGAINST DESIGN.MD",
              "lineHeight": 1.2,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 10,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 0.8
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Uq7cY",
              "name": "line",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "No control height or colour of its own: the rows are SettingsRow, the controls 32 px, the colours tokens; the caption buttons are Windows's.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "QU4DK",
              "name": "line",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Drawn from #356 at 2bc403a9 and #358's e2e/__screenshots__/win32/settings-terminal.png.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
