              "fontSize": 28,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "hREM1",
              "name": "intro",
              "fill": "$text-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 664,
              "content": "Since #375, a project whose memory an older Tars kept under a folder name Claude never reads (a path with _, a space or ~) is one row: Claude's folder, the older folder's files copied in once while Claude's held no MEMORY.md, never over a file it holds. The row names the older folder on a third line, cut to the row's width; hovering it shows its whole path. The older folder is kept as it was.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
