              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 946,
              "content": "Each row of the chat list has its actions behind the dots that show on the row the pointer is on: pin, rename, snooze, settle, make it the project's inbox, delete. Delete asks first; when the chats' store refuses, the row says why in the store's own words, and names the work out. A chat deleted whose runner's worktree stays on disk, or whose uncommitted work was saved on a branch, says so above the list, with the place and the branch, until ok puts it away.",
