              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 10,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 0.8
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "h16I3",
              "name": "line",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "The chat list reads the chats' records (chat:list, #361): every chat by project then number, each with its runner as the fleet has it now. Above it, how many chats work of the most this Mac runs (system:chatLimit): N of M working, its square idle at 0. Nothing else is shown of a chat in the list: no last line, no unread.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "Yt4rl",
          "name": "Sections",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 6,
          "padding": [
            8,
            0,
            0,
            0
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "zoMWb",
              "name": "caption",
              "fill": "$text-secondary",
              "content": "SECTIONS",
              "lineHeight": 1.2,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 10,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 0.8
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "L9T2z",
              "name": "line",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Settled and Snoozed, folded with their counts, take a chat first; then Pinned; then Working, a chat whose runner is in a turn; the rest is Active. In each, the most recently active first. The project filter keeps one project's chats.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "didnj",
          "name": "Shell · chats · list, a chat open",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 6,
          "padding": [
