        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "M2lBBG",
          "name": "t",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "content": "Delegated task · on the agent's panel, window and card, while it runs and once it ends",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "$font-display",
          "fontSize": 20,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "o68WJ",
          "name": "intro",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1100,
          "content": "A task delegated over ACP (delegate_task) runs in Tars's ACP client, outside the agent's terminal, and the terminal sits idle meanwhile. So the agent's panel, its window and its card show the run in place of the terminal: who delegated it, since when and for how long, the task's first line, what the agent says as it streams and each tool call with its state, the tokens and cost so far, and stop task and terminal. Once it ends they keep its outcome, its answer and its cost until terminal takes them back to the terminal. The same panel and card serve the classic shell and the new interface.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
