      "name": "Delegated task · notes, what the Backend sends",
      "theme": {
        "mode": "dark"
      },
      "width": 720,
      "fill": "$surface",
      "stroke": "$border",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 16,
      "padding": 32,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "zp1DR",
          "name": "title",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Delegated task on the agent's card: what the window needs from the Backend",
          "lineHeight": 1.1,
          "fontFamily": "$font-display",
          "fontSize": 28,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "u3zZZ5",
          "name": "Where it shows",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 6,
          "padding": [
            8,
            0,
            0,
            0
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "VyxhX",
              "name": "caption",
              "fill": "$text-secondary",
              "content": "WHERE IT SHOWS",
              "lineHeight": 1.2,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 10,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 0.8
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "hBkg8",
              "name": "line",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Dashboard: the agent's terminal panel, in every grid layout down to 3x3 in a 1200 by 800 window; the new interface's Dashboard is the same panel.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "p0NsX",
              "name": "line",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Agents: the agent's card, and its window (open): the run in the terminal column, its queue in the rail. The new interface opens the same page from More.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "piFQN",
              "name": "line",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "New interface, the project page: the team row says what the agent is on, the run, its latest call, its cost and its queue.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "NA1BF",
          "name": "States drawn",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 6,
          "padding": [
            8,
            0,
            0,
            0
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "NSqfl",
              "name": "caption",
              "fill": "$text-secondary",
              "content": "STATES DRAWN",
              "lineHeight": 1.2,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 10,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 0.8
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "UHnWV",
              "name": "line",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Running; ended done, failed and stopped; the terminal view while a run goes on (one line, show); the smallest pane; each dark and light.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "qp6XM",
          "name": "Main to window: one channel, agent:run, six events",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 6,
          "padding": [
            8,
            0,
            0,
            0
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "LoHEl",
              "name": "caption",
              "fill": "$text-secondary",
              "content": "MAIN TO WINDOW: ONE CHANNEL, AGENT:RUN, SIX EVENTS",
              "lineHeight": 1.2,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 10,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 0.8
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "ZBer5",
              "name": "line",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "run-started, once, when the session is open and its model set, before the turn (delegateOverAcp's onStarted, when task-ledger.ts files the task as started): agentId, runId (the task's id, t-xxxxxxxx), from (who asked: kind agent, chat, tars, telegram or user, with its id and display name), task (the whole text; the window shows its first line), startedAt (epoch ms), provider, model (RunModel: asked, taken, own, ranOn), permissionMode.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "YyrAp",
              "name": "line",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "run-text, as the agent's message streams (agent_message_chunk): agentId, runId, text (the chunk as sent). Coalesced by the main process to one event per 100 ms at most per run.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "pSohs",
              "name": "line",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "run-tool, on every tool_call and tool_call_update: agentId, runId, toolCallId, title (one line, the command when the adapter gives one), kind, status (pending, in_progress, completed or failed), at. Rows are keyed by toolCallId.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "I6Msgz",
              "name": "line",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "run-usage, on every usage_update: agentId, runId, inputTokens, outputTokens, totalTokens, costUSD (the adapter's cost.amount when it sends one, else priced from the model catalogue, never zero for want of a price).",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "JN3j0",
              "name": "line",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "run-ended, once, when the run settles: agentId, runId, outcome (completed, stopped or error), stopReason (end_turn, cancelled, turn_limit, permission_escalation_denied and the others), stoppedBy (you, its asker, its agent stopped or deleted, Tars quitting), error (when outcome is error), text (the final answer, whole), toolCalls and failedToolCalls (counts), backgroundStopped, usage and costUSD (final), endedAt.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "NhNZ5",
              "name": "line",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "agent-queue, whenever the agent's queue changes (core/one-task.ts, once that PR is in): agentId, waiting in order, each with taskId, from (display name), queuedAt and the task's first line.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "IWBuc",
          "name": "Window to main: two calls",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 6,
          "padding": [
            8,
            0,
            0,
            0
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "fhZbE",
              "name": "caption",
              "fill": "$text-secondary",
              "content": "WINDOW TO MAIN: TWO CALLS",
              "lineHeight": 1.2,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 10,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 0.8
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "e3cdH",
              "name": "line",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "agent:runs (invoke), on mount and after a reload: per agent, the run under way (the run-started fields, the text so far, its tool rows, its usage) or else its last ended run with the run-ended fields, and its queue. The events keep it current from there.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "s8mHCN",
              "name": "line",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "agent:run-stop (invoke) with agentId and runId: ends that run and nothing else, the agent and its terminal staying; it answers once run-ended went out.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "nzger",
              "name": "line",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "terminal and show are the window's own state: nothing is sent, and nothing is typed into the terminal.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "y7Upx8",
          "name": "When they arrive",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 6,
          "padding": [
            8,
            0,
            0,
            0
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Ozc3m",
              "name": "caption",
              "fill": "$text-secondary",
              "content": "WHEN THEY ARRIVE",
              "lineHeight": 1.2,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 10,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 0.8
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "H3Wdb9",
              "name": "line",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "run-started before any run-text, run-tool or run-usage of its run; run-ended last and once, even when the run is cut (stop, quit, a breach of plan mode). The main process keeps a run's last ended event until the agent's next run starts, so a window opened later still shows the outcome. Elapsed time is counted by the window from startedAt: no tick is sent.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "RANTy",
          "name": "What exists today",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 6,
          "padding": [
            8,
            0,
            0,
            0
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "b2fmxD",
              "name": "caption",
              "fill": "$text-secondary",
              "content": "WHAT EXISTS TODAY",
              "lineHeight": 1.2,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 10,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 0.8
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "ahd75",
              "name": "line",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "delegateOverAcp (services/acp/delegate.ts) already receives it all, and none of it reaches the window. Its onEvent forwards text, tool, plan and permission; usage is kept for the result and not forwarded; the tool entry carries no toolCallId, so an update cannot find its row; the asker is known to the run-task route (resolveCaller), not to the run. DelegationResult has the ended fields, but no outcome word, no stoppedBy and no count of failed calls.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "HQqHW",
          "name": "Choices to approve",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 6,
          "padding": [
            8,
            0,
            0,
            0
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "DpQCG",
              "name": "caption",
              "fill": "$text-secondary",
              "content": "CHOICES TO APPROVE",
              "lineHeight": 1.2,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 10,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 0.8
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "TiKOa",
              "name": "line",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "The run takes the terminal's place in the panel and the window while it runs; terminal brings the terminal back, with one line offering show.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "HGEq6",
              "name": "line",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "stop task ends the run only, beside the header's stop, which stops the agent and its run with it.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "GI0Mk",
              "name": "line",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "The ended state stays until terminal is pressed or the next task starts.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "AVXoT",
              "name": "line",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Messages stream in the terminal's mono; the final answer is set in the UI face, as prose.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
